⚡🇺🇸 Axios reports that most major GOP politicians have given up trying to influence Trump or oppose him, and that they are completely submissive, fearing the upcoming midterm elections.

The prevailing view in the party is that Trump will remain the most important figure in the GOP even after an electoral defeat and the end of his presidency, and that there is no point in opposing him on anything.

